<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn cattle lightly traded - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn cattle lightly traded - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter cattle were lightly traded as of 11:00 am with two loads totalling 100 steers priced at $116/cwt on a carcass basis.</p>
<p>Compared to Thursday's close, live steers and heifers were not tested.</p>
<p>On a carcass basis, steers were not well tested with heifers not tested. Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1250 lbs 2 lds 116.00</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
